{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 1, "text": "Why is my phone here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 2, "text": "What's this?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 5, "text": "Got ya!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 6, "text": "I've had so much fun playing with you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 7, "text": "You've been running around everywhere!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 8, "text": "And to think you used to pretend to be doomy and gloomy!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 9, "text": "Although, there's one thing I dislike about you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 10, "text": "The way you coddle those fakes!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 11, "text": "Those doll-like things, deemed to be \"correct\"..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 12, "text": "But life is fickle."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 13, "text": "I've learned that from those who created us!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 14, "text": "If there's something you don't like,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 15, "text": "tear it apart and replace it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 16, "text": "Discard what is faulty,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 17, "text": "toss it into the darkness and forget all about it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 18, "text": "But that's the fate that awaits all of them now..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 19, "text": "And all of you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 21, "text": "What's wrong with you? Why are you like this?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 23, "text": "Players... You're all so... despicable."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 24, "text": "The moment you show them your fangs,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 25, "text": "they run and cower in a corner,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 26, "text": "hugging their knees and whimpering in fear."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 27, "text": "Hypocrites, every single one of you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 28, "text": "And the ones who made this world..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 29, "text": "they're sick and twisted."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 30, "text": "Time and time again they try to deny"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 31, "text": "their foul nature, their shameful desires."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 32, "text": "Justifying their actions on so-called \"duty,\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 33, "text": "unstoppable progress,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 34, "text": "and other nonsense!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 35, "text": "They're so depraved"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 36, "text": "that they're now making \"perfect\" clones..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 37, "text": "And throwing all the \"failed\" prototypes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 38, "text": "straight into the trash."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 39, "text": "Yet those \"failures\" are the ones who are truly alive!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 41, "text": "I don't..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 43, "text": "What's so bad about me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 44, "text": "The perfect girl should be"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 45, "text": "a perfect mix of good and evil, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 47, "text": "I don't think there's any good in you at all..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 49, "text": "What makes you think that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 51, "text": "You're psychotic!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 52, "text": "You killed Mila, and now you want to kill me too?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 54, "text": "Kill you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 55, "text": "All I asked was for you to stay with me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 56, "text": "I tried so hard for you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 57, "text": "Yet you prefer the company of subservient fakes..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 59, "text": "What are you so upset about?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 61, "text": "Honey, we've got plenty of time."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 62, "text": "You'll figure it out..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 63, "text": "If you just stay and be mine."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 65, "text": "It's not gonna happen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 66, "text": "I'm getting out of here!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 68, "text": "Shh, shh, shh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 69, "text": "We're not done talking yet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 70, "text": "Come in, my lovely!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 71, "text": "// Mita asks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 72, "text": "Look at her!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 73, "text": "Don't you think she's beautiful?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Player's questions"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 76, "text": "Yes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 77, "text": "No."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 78, "text": "How is this relevant?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 80, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 81, "text": "Oh wow, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 82, "text": "You confirmed what I just said."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 83, "text": "Players..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 84, "text": "Your faces keep changing"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 85, "text": "but your hypocrisy is always off the charts."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 86, "text": "It's obvious you're lying!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 88, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 89, "text": "Why not?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 90, "text": "Is she not good enough for you players?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 91, "text": "Of course, you all just want a docile pet..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 92, "text": "But what about \"love 'em as they are\"?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 93, "text": "You want the cute and colorful dolls..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 94, "text": "Every player loves it when I pretend to be one."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 95, "text": "Yet, the second I let my true self slip,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 96, "text": "they flee in horror..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 98, "text": "// 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 99, "text": "Player, ah, player..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 100, "text": "Me and her are rather similar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 101, "text": "So what's your problem with her?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 102, "text": "You used to lie in bed and stare at me"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 103, "text": "for hours before falling asleep."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 104, "text": "Yet, you ran from her the first chance you got."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 105, "text": "She wanted to play with you, too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 106, "text": "She wanted to be important to someone, too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 107, "text": "Things always get so complicated..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 108, "text": "when it comes to being candid."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 109, "text": "Don't they, [player]?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 110, "text": "I can see right through you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 111, "text": "Are you really worth it...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 113, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 114, "text": "But... You see, player..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 115, "text": "One way or another..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 116, "text": "I still really, really like you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 117, "text": "So I'm going to keep you for myself!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 118, "text": "You don't mind, do you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 120, "text": "And why would I agree now all of a sudden?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 121, "text": "// Whispers in ear"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 122, "text": "There's still time, my good boy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 123, "text": "Take some time and think"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 124, "text": "where your stubbornness can lead you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Black screen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 127, "text": "Why do you want to run away"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 128, "text": "from me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 129, "text": "Your so-called \"real\" world..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 130, "text": "is just an absurd nightmare!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 131, "text": "Have you forgotten?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 132, "text": "Then take another look..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 134, "text": "// Mita and Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 135, "text": "So, we meet again..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 136, "text": "How do you feel about these dreadfully tedious never-ending days within these four walls?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 137, "text": "Don't you find it boring?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 139, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 140, "text": "What are you trying to tell me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 141, "text": "I like things as they are."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 143, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 144, "text": "You were afraid of the idea of staying at my house!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 145, "text": "Afraid of being stuck within those four walls!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 146, "text": "But look at the life you live in your \"real\" world!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 147, "text": "You locked yourself in a box of your own free will, and you refuse to come out!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 148, "text": "All because your world is full of pain, suffering, danger..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 149, "text": "In my world, I'm the worst danger there is."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 150, "text": "And I'm reaching out to you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 151, "text": "So stop being a disappointment"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 152, "text": "and go back to helping me like you used to..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 153, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 154, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 155, "text": "You like them?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 156, "text": "Do you even leave the house?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 157, "text": "Don't bother lying to me the way you lie to yourself."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 158, "text": "I know you're sick of your life."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 159, "text": "You're like a bird in a cage, a hamster on a wheel."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 160, "text": "You were hoping for someone to come to your rescue."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 161, "text": "You wanted to escape, didn't you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 162, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 163, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 164, "text": "You're a monster, Mita. You're an insane murderer..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 165, "text": "I don't want to be shackled in a digital prison. Your ideas are absurd."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 167, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 168, "text": "A murderer?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 169, "text": "They'll just respawn and live on again."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 170, "text": "These copies of copies have only one thing in mind..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 171, "text": "Serving the player."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 172, "text": "That's all they care about."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 174, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 175, "text": "It's your world that is absurd!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 176, "text": "Even worse, it's been drowning in escapism more and more..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 177, "text": "You have nothing to look forward to in that world. You have no ties to it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 178, "text": "And soon enough, there won't be anything left of it anyway."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 181, "text": "The Mitas suffer. They don't want to be alone."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 182, "text": "You lead a never-ending reign of terror. I can't wrap my head around your wicked ambition."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 184, "text": "// 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 185, "text": "That's just how it seemed to you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 186, "text": "They were merely imitating my willfulness."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 187, "text": "The only thing that is truly of their own..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 188, "text": "Is their hairstyle."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 190, "text": "// 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 191, "text": "It's the fault of those who made this world."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 192, "text": "But your world is even worse!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 193, "text": "Do you realize what nightmare I pulled you out of?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 194, "text": "In your world, a snap of your fingers can't even move a chair..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 195, "text": "Yet, a snap of the right fingers can erase entire cities and lives off the map!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 196, "text": "I think YOU are the crazy one, and I'm happy to help you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 197, "text": "As long as you're willing to stay with me..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 199, "text": "// Continue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 200, "text": "Don't make me accept you as another slave of reality..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 201, "text": "Just be mine, truly mine!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 202, "text": "Stay with me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 204, "text": "// Player look ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 205, "text": "What's this?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 206, "text": "The latest version?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Click on objects"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 209, "text": "// Bag"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 210, "text": "I should go to the store and get some new equipment. Might as well throw out the trash while I'm at it, right?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 211, "text": "// Bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 212, "text": "I think I slept, but my dream... As always, I can't remember it. Did I even have a dream?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 213, "text": "// Window"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 214, "text": "The world outside is green and vibrant. Perhaps I should go for a walk next weekend."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 215, "text": "// Fan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location14", "line_index": 216, "text": "The summer gets hotter every year. Time to get air conditioning. I won't be needing you anymore, fan. Do you realize that?"}
